# POLLY, a song's end with the Ending on: "At end: again" loops to section 1 and never plays the Ending, so HOME's next
# line says section 1 on the last section, not the Ending; "stop" plays the Ending ("next: Ending"). One section (P1).
wait 300
tap HOME
expect page 1
tapkey w0
expect rows 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page 2
expect knob3_is_on 1
turn K4 1
expect knob4_is_again 1
tap HOME
expect page 0
tap PLAY
wait 6000
expect sect 2
expect row 1
expect next_is_next:_P1_(C) 1
# ---- At end: stop: the last section's next is the Ending
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
expect page 2
turn K4 -1
expect knob4_is_stop 1
tap HOME
expect next_is_next:_Ending 1
tap PLAY
